alse,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":2},{"key":"investment","title":"Your investment","paragraphs":[{"text":"Your investment is £16,606, in full, up front, with 5% off.","why":null},{"text":"Invoices come from Stripe and are due within 14 days. You can settle each one by card, Apple Pay or bank transfer, and instalments can be by Direct Debit.","why":null},{"text":"The first £16,606 is settled when you sign, to confirm your place.","why":null},{"text":"Travel and other agreed expenses, if any, are invoiced at cost.","why":null},{"text":"If an invoice is unsettled 14 days after it’s due, your coach may pause new coaching sessions until it’s settled, always after talking to you first.","why":"It’s rare, and it’s always a conversation first."}],"money":true,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":3,"choices":{"upfront":[{"text":"Your investment is £16,606, in full, up front, with 5% off.","why":null},{"text":"Invoices come from Stripe and are due within 14 days. You can settle each one by card, Apple Pay or bank transfer, and instalments can be by Direct Debit.","why":null},{"text":"The first £16,606 is settled when you sign, to confirm your place.","why":null},{"text":"Travel and other agreed expenses, if any, are invoiced at cost.","why":null},{"text":"If an invoice is unsettled 14 days after it’s due, your coach may pause new coaching sessions until it’s settled, always after talking to you first.","why":"It’s rare, and it’s always a conversation first."}],"plan":[{"text":"Your investment is £17,480, in 6 monthly instalments of £2,913.33.","why":null},{"text":"Invoices come from Stripe and are due within 14 days. You can settle each one by card, Apple Pay or bank transfer, and instalments can be by Direct Debit.","why":null},{"text":"The first £2,913.35 is settled when you sign, to confirm your place.","why":null},{"text":"Travel and other agreed expenses, if any, are invoiced at cost.","why":null},{"text":"If an invoice is unsettled 14 days after it’s due, your coach may pause new coaching sessions until it’s settled, always after talking to you first.","why":"It’s rare, and it’s always a conversation first."}]}},{"key":"rearranging","title":"Rearranging and cancelling","paragraphs":[{"text":"You can rearrange or cancel a coaching session at no charge up to 24 hours before it starts, from the portal or by letting your coach know.","why":"Your coaching session is time held only for you, and 24 hours lets your coach offer it to someone else."},{"text":"A coaching session cancelled with less than 24 hours’ notice, or missed without notice, counts as used.","why":"The time can rarely be filled at short notice, so it’s treated the same as a coaching session that happened."},{"text":"If you’re late, the coaching session still ends at its usual time. If your coach is late, you get the full time.","why":"It keeps the next person’s time safe, and your coach holds themselves to the same standard."},{"text":"Your coach can waive any of this when something serious happens, such as illness or a family emergency. Just let them know.","why":"Life happens. The rule is for planning, not for hard moments."},{"text":"If your coach needs to move a coaching session, they offer you a new time, and it’s never counted as used.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":4},{"key":"confidentiality","title":"Confidentiality and records","paragraphs":[{"text":"What you share in coaching stays between you and your coach.","why":null},{"text":"It is not shared with anyone else, including an organisation that funds your coaching, without your agreement.","why":null},{"text":"The only exceptions are where there is a serious risk of harm to you or someone else, or where the law requires it. Your coach would talk to you first wherever they can.","why":null},{"text":"Your coach keeps private notes and session summaries for this coaching. Recordings are kept until this agreement ends, then deleted.","why":null},{"text":"Your coach may discuss their practice in professional supervision, without naming you.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":5},{"key":"data","title":"Your data","paragraphs":[{"text":"The Clarity Portal keeps your data securely, as the privacy notice explains.","why":null},{"text":"You choose what your coach sees in the portal, and you can change it any time in My Account.","why":null},{"text":"You can download or delete your data at any time. Coaching records such as this agreement and invoices are kept for 6 years after it ends, because UK law requires it.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":6},{"key":"responsibilities","title":"Responsibilities","paragraphs":[{"text":"Your coach turns up prepared, keeps to this agreement, and is honest with you, including when coaching isn’t the right support for something.","why":null},{"text":"You own your decisions and the actions you take between coaching sessions, and you tell your coach early if something isn’t working.","why":null},{"text":"Coaching isn’t therapy, counselling or medical advice. If something would be better helped by another professional, your coach will say so and can suggest someone.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":7},{"key":"ending","title":"Ending and changes","paragraphs":[{"text":"This agreement runs for its full 6 months. If something exceptional happens, talk to your coach and you’ll agree together what’s fair.","why":"Real change takes steady work over months, so you both commit to the full six."},{"text":"Coaching sessions not used by the end date expire, unless you agree an extension with your coach.","why":"It keeps momentum: coaching works best at a steady rhythm. Ask early and an extension is usually easy."},{"text":"Any change to this agreement is made as a new version that you both sign. Every version is kept.","why":null},{"text":"Your portal account stays open after the agreement ends, so your plans and records stay yours.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":8},{"key":"cooling","title":"Changing your mind in the first 14 days","paragraphs":[{"text":"You can cancel this agreement within 14 days of signing, for any reason, and get a full refund.","why":null},{"text":"If you ask for your coaching to start within those 14 days and then cancel, you’re only charged for the coaching sessions you’ve had.","why":null},{"text":"To cancel, tell your coach in writing, by email or in the portal.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":9},{"key":"concerns","title":"Concerns and law","paragraphs":[{"text":"If you have a concern, tell your coach first. If it isn’t resolved, you and your coach agree on an independent mediator to help.","why":null},{"text":"This agreement is governed by the law of England and Wales.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":10},{"key":"signatures","title":"Signatures","paragraphs":[{"text":"Signed for The Clarity Project LTD by Alex Morgan, then by you.","why":null},{"text":"The signing record shows each person’s verified email, the date and time, and the document’s fingerprint.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":11}]'::jsonb, 'GBP', null, null, 1748000, null, polish_seed.ts('2026-10-10 08:00'), '5eed0600-000b-4000-8000-000000000001', polish_seed.ts('2026-10-10 08:00'), 'agreement', null, null, polish_seed.ts('2026-10-10 08:00')),
