r for all of them.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":2},{"key":"investment","title":"Your investment","paragraphs":[{"text":"Your coaching is funded by Halden Freight under a separate agreement, so there is nothing for you to settle.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":3},{"key":"rearranging","title":"Rearranging and cancelling","paragraphs":[{"text":"You can rearrange or cancel a coaching session at no charge up to 24 hours before it starts, from the portal or by letting your coach know.","why":"Your coaching session is time held only for you, and 24 hours lets your coach offer it to someone else."},{"text":"A coaching session cancelled with less than 24 hours’ notice, or missed without notice, counts as used.","why":"The time can rarely be filled at short notice, so it’s treated the same as a coaching session that happened."},{"text":"If you’re late, the coaching session still ends at its usual time. If your coach is late, you get the full time.","why":"It keeps the next person’s time safe, and your coach holds themselves to the same standard."},{"text":"Your coach can waive any of this when something serious happens, such as illness or a family emergency. Just let them know.","why":"Life happens. The rule is for planning, not for hard moments."},{"text":"If your coach needs to move a coaching session, they offer you a new time, and it’s never counted as used.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":4},{"key":"confidentiality","title":"Confidentiality and records","paragraphs":[{"text":"What you share in coaching stays between you and your coach.","why":null},{"text":"It is not shared with anyone else, including an organisation that funds your coaching, without your agreement.","why":null},{"text":"The only exceptions are where there is a serious risk of harm to you or someone else, or where the law requires it. Your coach would talk to you first wherever they can.","why":null}