ay discuss their practice in professional supervision, without naming you.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":5},{"key":"data","title":"Your data","paragraphs":[{"text":"The Clarity Portal keeps your data securely, as the privacy notice explains.","why":null},{"text":"You choose what your coach sees in the portal, and you can change it any time in My Account.","why":null},{"text":"You can download or delete your data at any time. Coaching records such as this agreement and invoices are kept for 6 years after it ends, because UK law requires it.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":6},{"key":"responsibilities","title":"Responsibilities","paragraphs":[{"text":"Your coach turns up prepared, keeps to this agreement, and is honest with you, including when coaching isn’t the right support for something.","why":null},{"text":"You own your decisions and the actions you take between coaching sessions, and you tell your coach early if something isn’t working.","why":null},{"text":"Coaching isn’t therapy, counselling or medical advice. If something would be better helped by another professional, your coach will say so and can suggest someone.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":7},{"key":"ending","title":"Ending and changes","paragraphs":[{"text":"This agreement runs for its full 6 months. If something exceptional happens, talk to your coach and you’ll agree together what’s fair.","why":"Real change takes steady work over months, so you both commit to the full six."},{"text":"Coaching sessions not used by the end date expire, unless you agree an extension with your coach.","why":"It keeps momentum: coaching works best at a steady rhythm. Ask early and an extension is usually easy."},{"text":"Any change to this agreement is made as a new version that you both sign. Every version is kept.","why":null},{"text":"Your portal account stays open after the agreement ends, so your plans and record