ch may discuss their practice in professional supervision, without naming you.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":5},{"key":"data","title":"Your data","paragraphs":[{"text":"The Clarity Portal keeps your data securely, as the privacy notice explains.","why":null},{"text":"You choose what your coach sees in the portal, and you can change it any time in My Account.","why":null},{"text":"You can download or delete your data at any time. Coaching records such as this agreement and invoices are kept for 6 years after it ends, because UK law requires it.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":6},{"key":"responsibilities","title":"Responsibilities","paragraphs":[{"text":"Your coach turns up prepared, keeps to this agreement, and is honest with you, including when coaching isn’t the right support for something.","why":null},{"text":"You own your decisions and the actions you take between coaching sessions, and you tell your coach early if something isn’t working.","why":null},{"text":"Coaching isn’t therapy, counselling or medical advice. If something would be better helped by another professional, your coach will say so and can suggest someone.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":7},{"key":"ending","title":"Ending and changes","paragraphs":[{"text":"This agreement runs for its full 6 months. If something exceptional happens, talk to your coach and you’ll agree together what’s fair.","why":"Real change takes steady work over months, so you both commit to the full six."},{"text":"Coaching sessions not used by the end date expire, unless you agree an extension with your coach.","why":"It keeps momentum: coaching works best at a steady rhythm. Ask early and an extension is usually easy."},{"text":"Any change to this agreement is made as a new version that you both sign. Every version is kept.","why":null},{"text":"Your portal account stays open after the agreement ends, so your plans and records stay yours.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":8},{"key":"cooling","title":"Changing your mind in the first 14 days","paragraphs":[{"text":"You can cancel this agreement within 14 days of signing, for any reason, and get a full refund.","why":null},{"text":"If you ask for your coaching to start within those 14 days and then cancel, you’re only charged for the coaching sessions you’ve had.","why":null},{"text":"To cancel, tell your coach in writing, by email or in the portal.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":9},{"key":"concerns","title":"Concerns and law","paragraphs":[{"text":"If you have a concern, tell your coach first. If it isn’t resolved, you and your coach agree on an independent mediator to help.","why":null},{"text":"This agreement is governed by the law of England and Wales.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":10},{"key":"signatures","title":"Signatures","paragraphs":[{"text":"Signed for The Clarity Project LTD by Alex Morgan, then by you.","why":null},{"text":"The signing record shows each person’s verified email, the date and time, and the document’s fingerprint.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":11}]'::jsonb, 'GBP', null, null, 1048000, null, polish_seed.ts('2026-05-25 08:00'), '5eed0600-000b-4000-8000-000000000001', polish_seed.ts('2026-05-25 08:00'), 'agreement', null, null, polish_seed.ts('2026-05-25 08:00')),
