The Clarity Portal is included for the length of this agreement, at the Executive level.","why":null},{"text":"Between coaching sessions you can reach your coach by WhatsApp or Chat in the portal, and they reply within 2 working days.","why":null},{"text":"Your coaching sessions are recorded with Fathom to write your session summary, only with your agreement. You can say no at any time, for one coaching session or for all of them.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":2},{"key":"investment","title":"Your investment","paragraphs":[{"text":"Your investment is £18,000: a deposit of £6,000, then 3 instalments of £4,000.","why":null},{"text":"Invoices are sent to finance@brightwater.example.com and are due within 14 days, settled by bank transfer quoting the invoice number.","why":null},{"text":"Travel and other agreed expenses, if any, are invoiced at cost.","why":null}],"money":true,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":3},{"key":"rearranging","title":"Rearranging and cancelling","paragraphs":[{"text":"You can rearrange or cancel a coaching session at no charge up to 24 hours before it starts, from the portal or by letting your coach know.","why":"Your coaching session is time held only for you, and 24 hours lets your coach offer it to someone else."},{"text":"A coaching session cancelled with less than 24 hours’ notice, or missed without notice, counts as used.","why":"The time can rarely be filled at short notice, so it’s treated the same as a coaching session that happened."},{"text":"If you’re late, the coaching session still ends at its usual time. If your coach is late, you get the full time.","why":"It keeps the next person’s time safe, and your coach holds themselves to the same standard."},{"text":"Your coach can waive any of this when something serious happens, such as illness or a family emergency. Just let them know.","why":"Life happens. The rule is for planning, not for hard moments."},{"text":"If your coach needs to move a coaching session, they offer you a new time, and it’s never counted as used.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":4},{"key":"confidentiality","title":"Confidentiality and records","paragraphs":[{"text":"What you share in coaching stays between you and your coach.","why":null},{"text":"It is not shared with anyone else, including an organisation that funds your coaching, without your agreement.","why":null},{"text":"You hear when coaching starts and ends, and how many coaching sessions are used, never what is said.","why":null},{"text":"The only exceptions are where there is a serious risk of harm to you or someone else, or where the law requires it. Your coach would talk to you first wherever they can.","why":null},{"text":"Your coach keeps private notes and session summaries for this coaching. Recordings are kept until this agreement ends, then deleted.","why":null},{"text":"Your coach may discuss their practice in professional supervision, without naming you.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":5},{"key":"data","title":"Your data","paragraphs":[{"text":"The Clarity Portal keeps your data securely, as the privacy notice explains.","why":null},{"text":"You choose what your coach sees in the portal, and you can change it any time in My Account.","why":null},{"text":"You can download or delete your data at any time. Coaching records such as this agreement and invoices are kept for 6 years after it ends, because UK law requires it.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":6},{"key":"responsibilities","title":"Responsibilities","paragraphs":[{"text":"Your coach turns up prepared, keeps to this agreement, and is honest with you, including when coaching isn’t the right support for something.","why":null},{"text":"You own your decisions and the actions you take between coaching sessions, and you tell your coach early if something isn’t working.","why":null},{"text":"Coaching isn’t therapy, counselling or medical advice. If something would be better helped by another professional, your coach will say so and can suggest someone.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":7},{"key":"ending","title":"Ending and changes","paragraphs":[{"text":"Either of you can end this agreement early with 30 days’ notice in writing.","why":"You’re never locked in, and you never invest in coaching you don’t get."},{"text":"Any change to this agreement is made as a new version that you both sign. Every version is kept.","why":null},{"text":"Your portal account stays open after the agreement ends, so your plans and records stay yours.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":8},{"key":"concerns","title":"Concerns and law","paragraphs":[{"text":"If you have a concern, tell your coach first. If it isn’t resolved, you and your coach agree on an independent mediator to help.","why":null},{"text":"This agreement is governed by the law of England and Wales.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":9},{"key":"signatures","title":"Signatures","paragraphs":[{"text":"Signed for The Clarity Project LTD by Alex Morgan, then for Brightwater Care Partners by Margaret Hale.","why":null},{"text":"The signing record shows each person’s verified email, the date and time, and the document’s fingerprint.","why":null}],"money":false,"base":"code","edited":false,"number":10}]'::jsonb, 'GBP', null, null, 1800000, 'Brightwater Care Partners', polish_seed.ts('2026-09-03 08:00'), '5eed0600-000b-4000-8000-000000000001', polish_seed.ts('2026-09-03 08:00'), 'agreement', null, null, polish_seed.ts('2026-09-03 08:00'));
